{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39973","headline":"赠黄校书先辈璞闲居 · 徐夤","name":"赠黄校书先辈璞闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驭得骊龙第四珠，退依僧寺卜贫居。\n青山入眼不干禄，白发满头犹着书。\n东涧野香添碧沼，南园夜雨长秋蔬。\n月明扫石吟诗坐，讳却全无儋石储。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}